> EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, COSTS OFF, TIMING OFF, SUMMARY OFF, BUFFERS OFF)
> SELECT o.k, (SELECT count(*) FROM a167_r r JOIN a167_n n ON n.rk = r.rk + o.k % 2 WHERE r.rk < 3) AS c
> FROM a167_o o WHERE o.k <= 10
QUERY PLAN:text
Seq Scan on a167_o o (actual rows=10.00 loops=1)
  Filter: (k <= 10)
  Rows Removed by Filter: 20
  SubPlan 1
    ->  Aggregate (actual rows=1.00 loops=10)
          ->  Nested Loop (actual rows=6.00 loops=10)
                Join Filter: ((r.rk + (o.k % 2)) = n.rk)
                Rows Removed by Join Filter: 12
                ->  Seq Scan on a167_r r (actual rows=2.00 loops=10)
                      Filter: (rk < 3)
                      Rows Removed by Filter: 1
                ->  Seq Scan on a167_n n (actual rows=9.00 loops=20)
